(footprint "XL-3332RGBC-WS2812B" (version 20221018) (generator pcbnew)
  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "NOT CURRENTLY USED - kept on the shelf for a possible future LED change; LED1-LED36 remain XL-3030RGBC / C5349958. XINGLIGHT XL-3332RGBC-WS2812B / LCSC C42400839. Addressable RGB LED, 3.3 x 3.2 x 0.8 mm, water clear, top-mount. Pad sizes and positions match the LCSC/EasyEDA footprint for this part (3.20x0.65 bands at y +/-1.325, 1.10x0.80 blocks at x +/-1.05), which is the de-facto reference: the datasheet publishes only a package outline and NO Recommended Soldering Pattern. Pin numbers come from the KiCad LED:WS2812B symbol - 1 VDD, 2 DOUT, 3 VSS, 4 DIN - corroborated by the nets on the working v3.2 boards. The XL-3332RGBC datasheet does NOT number its pins at all, it labels them by name only; the sibling XL-3030RGBC datasheet does carry a numbered function table and agrees. So: 1 VDD top band, 2 DO right, 3 GND bottom band, 4 DI left, viewed from the component side. NOTE: EasyEDA numbers its own pads differently (its right block is 3), so do not cross-check numbering against that file - only geometry. DO-on-the-right is confirmed by the DOUT silkscreen label in the EasyEDA footprint.")
  (tags "LED RGB WS2812B XINGLIGHT 3332 addressable")
